Harbourview Hospice, Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada
Pt: Yannis Pappas  (a.k.a. Ioannis Papadopoulos)   DOB 05/17/2037   MRN HLX-0065-4410   Rm 6
Date/time of death: 11/18/2092 03:45. Age 55.
