Pronounced by Linh Tran MD at 03:45; verified by RN Aisha Bangura. No autopsy. Coroner not needed.
Family notified: partner Sunita Rao present at bedside. Sister Eleftheria Papadopoulou, Egnatia 112, 546 35 Thessaloniki, Greece, ph +30 2310 555 014 - by phone 04:30 (it was 10:30 there). Son Nikolas Pappas, 7 Mill Lane, Ballincollig, Cork T12 AB34, Ireland, +353 21 555 0166 - flying in. 
Body to Tidewater Funeral Chapel. Death cert to be completed by Dr McAllister. Records on aliases: pls merge John Pappas chart.
Signed L. Tran, MD  11/18/2092 05:20
ADDENDUM 11/25/2092: auto wellness-visit reminder call placed to pt's mobile +1 (902) 555-0127 today - left msg for "Mr. Pappas" in error. Sunita Rao answered, was upset. Reminder cancelled. Pls fix recall list. -Ewan Gillis
